 "blocks": [
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "html": "Branch Office is also based on the following values in its business philosophy as the Bank:"
  },
  {
   "type": "list",
   "ordered": false,
   "items": [
    "Reliability",
    "Security",
    "Straightforwardness",
    "Accuracy",
    "Transparency",
    "High-quality service",
    "Partnership with customer",
    "Turn team members into “entrepreneurs”",
    "Contribution to Iran-Azerbaijan economic integration",
    "Respect for the laws of Azerbaijan."
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "html": "Bank is based on these values both in its business and institutional strategy and also daily activity."
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "html": "Bank’s aim is to establish permanent cooperation with team members and business partners and pay proper attention to them that they deserve."
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "html": "Mission statement"
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "html": "Bank offers the following challenges to both the employees of Branch Office and its customers that are business partners:"
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "html": "For employees – favorable working conditions, motivation, gaining confidence to continue their long – term relationships with branch, being a bank that develops employee’s carrier;"
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "html": "For business partners – gaining confidence by individual approach and high quality service. Especially, being the first choice bank for the participants of trade and economic relations between Iran and Azerbaijan."
  }
 ],
